  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Career Support Emma Ingemansson</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">S&#xe4;ckpengsanst&#xe4;llning Emma Ingemansson</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sida bidrar till l&#xf6;nekostnad f&#xf6;r hemv&#xe4;ndande arbetsl&#xf6;sa deltagare i   resursbasprogrammen under max fem m&#xe5;nader f&#xf6;r att underl&#xe4;tta          &#xe5;terintr&#xe4;det p&#xe5; den svenska arbetsmarknaden.                           Emma Ingemansson har fullgjort sin s&#xe4;ckpengsanst&#xe4;llning p&#xe5; Sida och  fick ocks&#xe5; en kortare fortsatt anst&#xe4;llning p&#xe5; Sidan efter det innan   hon hittade ett mer varaktigt arbete p&#xe5; DCAP i Tunis.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sida contributes to salary costs for homcoming unemployed             participants of resource base programs during a maximum of five       months to facilitate the reentry into the Swedish labour market.       Emma Ingemansson had her Career Support employment with Sida and      and got a continued employment with Sida for a shorter period of     time before she found a more long term employment with DCAP in Tunis.</narrative>
  </description>
